  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Load one EEG trial, either a synthetic phoneme trial or the first 1-second epoch of an uploaded EDF recording, view its channel waveforms and scalp topomap, and get a pretrained CNN-LSTM's predicted phoneme (/a e i o u p t k/) with per-class probabilities, alongside the true label for synthetic trials. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
